      "writtenOn": "2021-05-24T02:33:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL is the workaround to fix the issue:129908668. (i.e. JEN0 strap pin is strapped unexpectedly by the specific key combination.)\nWhen the JEN0 strap pin is strapped:\nNPCX5/NPCX7:\n - nJEN0_EN bit in DEVALT5 register is clear and JEN0_HSL bit in SIOCFD register \n   is set.\nNPCX9:\n - JEN_EN filed in JEN_CTL1 register is set to 0x09 and JEN0_HSL bit in SIOCFD register \n   is set.\nThis workaround is to revert the setting to disable the JTAG selection.\n\nWe are not sure if host has a chance to control the enabling/disabling of JTAG or not. So we don\u0027t touch the JEN_HEN.\nIf you think it is necessary, we can add it with another CL.",
      "parentUuid": "de24a4b5_290e4636",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 838,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 840,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "28d7bac7a3704d764fd28800514efaeeadf0b5cf",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
